      <Param name="Selected rows" updates="None" val="" valType="str"/>
      <Param name="conditions" updates="None" val="[{'item_number': 1, 'item': 'A bat and a ball cost $1.10 in total. The bat costs $1.00 more than the ball. How much does the ball cost?', 'unit': 'cents', 'type': 'crt'}, {'item_number': 2, 'item': 'If it takes 5 machines 5 minutes to make 5 widgets, how long would it take 100 machines to make 100 widgets?', 'unit': 'minutes', 'type': 'crt'}, {'item_number': 3, 'item': 'In a lake, there is a patch of lily pads. Every day, the patch doubles in size. If it takes 48 days for the patch to cover the entire lake, how long would it take for the patch to cover half of the lake?', 'unit': 'days', 'type': 'crt'}, {'item_number': 4, 'item': 'If you’re running a race and you pass the person in second place, what place are you in?', 'unit': 'place', 'type': 'crt'}, {'item_number': 5, 'item': 'A farmer had 15 sheep and all but 8 died. How many are left?', 'unit': 'sheep', 'type': 'crt'}, {'item_number': 6, 'item': 'Emily’s father has three daughters. The first two are named April and May. What is the third daughter’s name?', 'unit': ' ', 'type': 'crt'}, {'item_number': 7, 'item': 'How many cubic feet of dirt are there in a hole that is 3’ deep x 3’ wide x 3’ long?', 'unit': 'feet', 'type': 'crt'}, {'item_number': 8, 'item': 'A cargo hold of a ship had 500 crates of oranges. At the ship’s first stop, 100 crates were unloaded. At the second stop, 200 more were unloaded. How many crates of oranges were left after the second stop?', 'unit': 'crates', 'type': 'decoy'}, {'item_number': 9, 'item': 'Sara, Emma, and Sophia embark on a river trip. Each of them brings one supply item for the trip: a kayak, a cooler of sandwiches, and a bag of apples. Sara brought the apples and Emma didn’t bring anything edible. What did Sophia bring?', 'unit': ' ', 'type': 'decoy'}, {'item_number': 10, 'item': 'An expedition on a mountain climbing trip was traveling with eleven horse packs. Each horse can carry only three packs. How many horses does the expedition need?', 'unit': 'horses', 'type': 'decoy'}, {'item_number': 11, 'item': 'A mechanic shop had five silver cars, two red cars, and one blue car in the garage. During the day, three silver cars and one red car were picked up, and one black car was dropped off. How many silver cars were in the garage at the end of the day?', 'unit': 'cars', 'type': 'decoy'}]" valType="str"/>
      <Param name="conditionsFile" updates="None" val="crt_items.xlsx" valType="file"/>
